sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant MinIO as MinIO Storage<br/>9000/TCP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Content Analysis Request Flows

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note right of Orchestrator: Built-in Detector Flow
        Orchestrator->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentAnalysisHttpRequest
        BuiltIn->>BuiltIn: Regex & file-type<br/>pattern matching (local)
        BuiltIn-->>Orchestrator: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>(detection results)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note right of Orchestrator: HuggingFace Detector Flow
        Orchestrator->>HF: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentAnalysisHttpRequest
        Note right of HF: Model pre-loaded at startup
        HF->>MinIO: Load model artifacts<br/>(on init, port 9000)
        MinIO-->>HF: Model files (PVC-backed)
        HF->>HF: Local model inference<br/>(AutoModelForSequenceClassification<br/>/ GraniteForCausalLM)
        HF-->>Orchestrator: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>(classification results)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note right of Orchestrator: LLM Judge Detector Flow
        Orchestrator->>Judge: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentAnalysisHttpRequest
        Judge->>vLLM: HTTP POST (vllm-judge library)<br/>VLLM_BASE_URL=http://qwen2-predictor:8080
        vLLM-->>Judge: LLM evaluation response
        Judge->>Judge: Process evaluation metrics<br/>(safety, toxicity, accuracy,<br/>helpfulness)
        Judge-->>Orchestrator: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>(evaluation results)
    end

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Observability

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Orchestrator->>BuiltIn: GET /metrics
        BuiltIn-->>Orchestrator: Prometheus metrics<br/>(detections, requests, errors, latency)
        Orchestrator->>HF: GET /metrics
        HF-->>Orchestrator: Prometheus metrics
        Orchestrator->>Judge: GET /metrics
        Judge-->>Orchestrator: Prometheus metrics
    end
